This is a spelling heuristic, not a grammatical parser. It scores Cyrillic
locative/dative endings, Ukrainian -і, and Czech/Polish case-ending spellings.
Stem size, nearby prepositions, and whether the ending is a separate token
adjust its strength. Verb/adjective endings are weaker. Most Latin endings
require nearby Slavic spelling or function words; everything else is zero.
"""
